{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-design","title":"Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/graphql/schema-design","wordCount":576,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"schema-设计\">Schema 设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Schema 设计是 GraphQL API 成败的关键。一个好的 Schema 不仅是技术契约，更是<strong>产品的 API 接口</strong>——它应该反映业务领域的概念，而不是数据库的结构。Schema First（先定义 Schema）vs Code First（从代码生成 Schema）是两种主要的设计方法，各有适用场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Schema 设计] --&gt; B{设计方法}&#10;    B --&gt; C[Schema First]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Code First]&#10;    C --&gt; E[.graphql 文件]&#10;    D --&gt; F[TypeScript 定义]&#10;    E --&gt; G[代码生成]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[类型安全的 Resolver]&#10;    G --&gt; I[类型安全的客户端]\">graph TD\n    A[Schema 设计] --&gt; B{设计方法}\n    B --&gt; C[Schema First]\n    B --&gt; D[Code First]\n    C --&gt; E[.graphql 文件]\n    D --&gt; F[TypeScript 定义]\n    E --&gt; G[代码生成]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[类型安全的 Resolver]\n    G --&gt; I[类型安全的客户端]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>Schema First</th>\n<th>Code First</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义方式</td>\n<td><code>.graphql</code> SDL 文件</td>\n<td>TypeScript 代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优势</td>\n<td>语言无关、可读性好</td>\n<td>类型安全、可编程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>劣势</td>\n<td>Schema-代码同步</td>\n<td>可读性略差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>GraphQL Codegen</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>跨团队协作</td>\n<td>单团队全栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表工具</td>\n<td>Apollo Server + Codegen</td>\n<td>Pothos, Nexus</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"命名与约定\">命名与约定</h2><p>一致的命名约定让 Schema 自文档化。GraphQL 社区已形成广泛共识：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type User {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  firstName: String!&#10;  lastName: String!&#10;  emailAddress: String!&#10;  isActive: Boolean!&#10;  createdAt: DateTime!&#10;  updatedAt: DateTime!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Query {&#10;  user(id: ID!): User&#10;  users(filter: UserFilter, first: Int, after: String): UserConnection!&#10;  searchUsers(query: String!, first: Int): [User!]!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Mutation {&#10;  createUser(input: CreateUserInput!): CreateUserPayload!&#10;  updateUser(input: UpdateUserInput!): UpdateUserPayload!&#10;  deleteUser(id: ID!): DeleteUserPayload!&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  firstName: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lastName: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  emailAddress: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  isActive: Boolean!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createdAt: DateTime!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  updatedAt: DateTime!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Query {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user(id: ID!): User</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  users(filter: UserFilter, first: Int, after: String): UserConnection!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  searchUsers(query: String!, first: Int): [User!]!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Mutation {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createUser(input: CreateUserInput!): CreateUserPayload!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  updateUser(input: UpdateUserInput!): UpdateUserPayload!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deleteUser(id: ID!): DeleteUserPayload!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface NamingConvention {&#10;  element: string;&#10;  convention: string;&#10;  example: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const conventions: NamingConvention[] = [&#10;  { element: &#39;类型名&#39;, convention: &#39;PascalCase&#39;, example: &#39;UserProfile&#39; },&#10;  { element: &#39;字段名&#39;, convention: &#39;camelCase&#39;, example: &#39;firstName&#39; },&#10;  { element: &#39;枚举值&#39;, convention: &#39;SCREAMING_SNAKE&#39;, example: &#39;ADMIN&#39; },&#10;  { element: &#39;Input 类型&#39;, convention: &#39;{Action}{Type}Input&#39;, example: &#39;CreateUserInput&#39; },&#10;  { element: &#39;Payload 类型&#39;, convention: &#39;{Action}{Type}Payload&#39;, example: &#39;CreateUserPayload&#39; },&#10;  { element: &#39;布尔字段&#39;, convention: &#39;is/has/can 前缀&#39;, example: &#39;isActive, hasAccess&#39; },&#10;  { element: &#39;列表字段&#39;, convention: &#39;复数名词&#39;, example: &#39;users, tags&#39; },&#10;  { element: &#39;连接字段&#39;, convention: &#39;{Type}Connection&#39;, example: &#39;UserConnection&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NamingConvention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  convention</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  example</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> conventions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NamingConvention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { element: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'类型名'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, convention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PascalCase'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UserProfile'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { element: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'字段名'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, convention: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'camelCase'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, example: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'firstName'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { element: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'枚举值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E